---
import NewSimbaliLayout from '../layouts/NewSimbaliLayout.astro';

const seo = {
  "title": "Bespoke Safari Experiences | Families, Couples, Groups & Milestone Travel",
  "description": "Discover safari experiences designed around why you travel: legacy family trips, honeymoons, milestone celebrations, private groups, cultural connection, helicopter safaris, conservancies and bush-and-beach retreats.",
  "keywords": "bespoke safari experiences, family safari East Africa, honeymoon safari, private group safari, milestone safari travel, cultural safari, helicopter safari, bush and beach safari",
  "jsonLd": {
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Bespoke Safari Experiences",
    "serviceType": "Luxury safari planning",
    "areaServed": [
      "Kenya",
      "Tanzania",
      "Rwanda",
      "Uganda",
      "Zanzibar"
    ]
  }
};
---

<NewSimbaliLayout {...seo}>
<section class="page-hero experience-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="eyebrow" style="color:#e4c89b">Experience</div>
<h1>Travel Built Around Why You Are Going.</h1>
<p>We begin with the people, the occasion and the feeling you want to bring home—then build the right combination of wildlife, culture, privacy, place and pace around you.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div class="feature-list traveler-grid">
<div class="feature" id="legacy">
<h3>The Legacy Family</h3>
<p>Private vehicles, flexible pacing and meaningful shared experiences for parents, children and grandchildren. We design around the family as a whole—not the youngest or oldest traveler alone.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature" id="milestone">
<h3>The Milestone Traveler</h3>
<p>Birthdays, anniversaries, retirement, honeymoons and celebrations deserve experiences that feel personal rather than pre-packaged—from private sundowners to carefully timed bush-and-beach combinations.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature" id="couple">
<h3>The Africa-Curious Affluent Couple</h3>
<p>For experienced international travelers who have always wanted to do Africa but do not want to figure it out alone. We turn uncertainty into a clear, beautifully paced first journey.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature" id="group">
<h3>The Private Group</h3>
<p>For 6–14 friends or families who want to travel together without traveling like a tour group—exclusive vehicles, villas or camps, private guides and shared moments designed around the group.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature" id="connected">
<h3>The African Diaspora / Africa-Connected Executive</h3>
<p>For travelers who want more cultural intelligence, deeper connection and more sophistication than a conventional safari can provide.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
<h3>Your Own Reason</h3>
<p>Executive retreat, destination wedding, photographic interest, conservation focus or simply the desire to be somewhere extraordinary—we can begin with the occasion rather than a package.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section experience-services">
<div class="container">
<div class="center">
<h2>Our Bespoke Experiences</h2>
<div class="section-kicker">The wild is only one part of the story.</div>
</div>
<div class="grid-4">
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Luxury Safaris &amp; Excursions</h3>
<p>Thoughtfully paced wildlife journeys with excellent guides, intimate camps and seamless logistics.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Private Conservancies</h3>
<p>More privacy, flexible activity options and greater scope for unhurried encounters.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Helicopter &amp; Scenic Flight Safaris</h3>
<p>Perspective-changing access and dramatic landscapes when aviation meaningfully improves the journey.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Signature Honeymoons</h3>
<p>Romantic camps, private dining, beach extensions and a pace built for two.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Curated Cultural Immersions</h3>
<p>Respectful experiences centered on people, stories, traditions and shared humanity.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Destination Weddings</h3>
<p>Exceptional settings paired with travel planning for the people who matter most.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Executive Team Retreats</h3>
<p>Private, purposeful journeys that create space for perspective, connection and renewal.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card">
<h3>Bush + Beach</h3>
<p>Safari followed by Indian Ocean restoration—the perfect change of rhythm.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container grid-2">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Culture &amp; Connection</div>
<h2>More Than a Wildlife Checklist.</h2>
<p class="lead">The richest journeys leave room for the people and cultures that make East Africa what it is.</p>
<p>We approach cultural experiences with specificity, respect and genuine connection—favoring moments that deepen understanding rather than turning communities into attractions.</p>
</div>
<div>
<img style="height:440px" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523805009345-7448845a9e53?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="East Africa experience">
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="final-cta">
<div class="container">
<h2>What Are You Celebrating?</h2>
<div class="section-kicker">Start with the reason. We'll design the journey around it.</div>
<a class="button gold" href="/design-your-journey/">Design Your Journey</a>
</div>
</section>
</NewSimbaliLayout>
